  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\alpha, \\beta ; \\alpha>\\beta$, be the roots of the equation $x^2-\\sqrt{2} x-\\sqrt{3}=0$. Let $\\mathrm{P}_n=\\alpha^n-\\beta^n, n \\in \\mathrm{N}$. Then $(11 \\sqrt{3}-10 \\sqrt{2}) \\mathrm{P}_{10}+(11 \\sqrt{2}+10) \\mathrm{P}_{11}-11 \\mathrm{P}_{12}$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "7PKPs",
      "text": "$10 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{P}_9$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1lZEg",
      "text": "$11 \\sqrt{3} P_9$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uqkY9",
      "text": "$10 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{P}_9$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LV52i",
      "text": "$11 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{P}_9$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{x}^2-\\sqrt{2 \\mathrm{x}}-\\sqrt{3}=0\\left\\langle_\\beta^\\alpha\\right. \\\\\n& \\alpha^{\\mathrm{n}+2}-\\sqrt{2} \\alpha^{\\mathrm{n}+1}-\\sqrt{3} \\alpha^{\\mathrm{n}}=0 \\\\\n& \\text { and } \\beta^{\\mathrm{n}+2}-\\sqrt{2} \\beta^{\\mathrm{n}+1}-\\sqrt{3} \\beta^{\\mathrm{n}}=0\n\\end{aligned}$<br />Subtracting\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left(\\alpha^{\\mathrm{n}+2}-\\beta^{\\mathrm{n}+2}\\right)-\\sqrt{2}\\left(\\alpha^{\\mathrm{n}+1}-\\beta^{\\mathrm{n}+1}\\right)-\\sqrt{3}\\left(\\alpha^{\\mathrm{n}}-\\beta^{\\mathrm{n}}\\right)=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{n}+2}-\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{n}+1}-\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{n}}=0\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Put } \\mathrm{n}=10 \\\\ & \\mathrm{P}_{12}-\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{P}_{11}-\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{P}_{10}=0 \\\\ & \\mathrm{n}=9 \\\\ & \\mathrm{P}_{11}-\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{P}_{10}-\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{P}_9=0 \\\\ & 11\\left(\\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\mathrm{P}_{10}+\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{P}_{11}-\\mathrm{P}_{11}\\right)-10\\left(\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{P}_{10}-\\mathrm{P}_{11}\\right) \\\\ & =0-10\\left(-\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{P}_9\\right)=10 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{P}_9\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
